@startuml
title Governed MCP Build and Runtime Image Selection

skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false

component "Pinned Dockerfile" as DF
component "build-mcpo-filesystem.bash" as BUILD
artifact "omelas/mcpo-filesystem:beta\nmutable build tag" as TAG
artifact "Validated image\nsha256:2a55c88..." as IMG
component "mcpo.bash / resume-mcpo.bash" as RUN
component "Omelas-MCP-RW" as C
folder "awake-in-omelas" as O

DF --> BUILD
BUILD --> TAG : MCP_MCPO_BUILD_IMAGE
TAG --> IMG : build result
IMG --> RUN : MCP_MCPO_RUNTIME_IMAGE\nimmutable digest
RUN --> C
C --> O : RW mount

note right of BUILD
Legacy MCP_MCPO_IMAGE remains
as a deprecated compatibility
fallback for build selection.
end note

note right of RUN
Runtime precedence:
1. MCP_MCPO_RUNTIME_IMAGE
2. MCP_MCPO_IMAGE (deprecated)
3. validated immutable digest
end note
@enduml
